---
import Panel from './Panel.astro';
interface Props { facts?: boolean }
const { facts = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="band" aria-labelledby="data-title">
  <div class="wrap section data">
    <div class="data-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Data</p>
        <h2 id="data-title" class="display h2-md">Root cause, without your data leaving the cluster.</h2>
        <p class="data-lede">kwatch analyzes events and logs where they live.</p>
        <p class="data-small">Only optional anonymous usage stats and Pro license checks reach kwatch.dev. Never cluster names, namespaces, pod names, logs or events. Alerts go only to the channels you set up. <a href="https://docs.kwatch.dev/architecture/data-flow">What is sent</a></p>
      </div>
      {facts && (
        <ul class="facts">
          <li><strong>One pod.</strong> A small volume for state, nothing else to run.</li>
          <li><strong>50+ channels.</strong> Slack, Teams, PagerDuty, Opsgenie, email, webhooks.</li>
          <li><strong>Source available.</strong> Read every line on GitHub, under ELv2.</li>
        </ul>
      )}
    </div>
    <div class="panels">
      <Panel title="Anonymous usage stats">
        <dl class="rows">
          <div><dt>When</dt><dd>At most once a week</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Contains</dt><dd>An anonymous ID derived from your cluster (a one-way hash that can't be traced back to the cluster or linked to your license) and the kwatch version</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Control</dt><dd>On by default; turn off with <code>telemetry.enabled: false</code> or <code>KWATCH_TELEMETRY=false</code></dd></div>
        </dl>
      </Panel>
      <Panel title="Pro license check">
        <dl class="rows">
          <div><dt>When</dt><dd>Once a day, Pro only</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Contains</dt><dd>License ID, hashed cluster ID, kwatch version, node count</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Control</dt><dd>Part of Pro; Community sends none</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </Panel>
    </div>
    <p class="never on-ink"><strong>Never sent:</strong> cluster names, namespaces, pod names, logs or events.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .data-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(320px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 48px; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .data-lede { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-soft); max-width: 60ch; }
  .data-small { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 60ch; }
  .data-small a { text-decoration: underline; color: var(--text); }
  .facts { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 12px; font-size: 17px; }
  .facts li { background: var(--bg); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 24px; }
  .never { margin-top: 16px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--ink-text); border: 1px solid var(--ink-line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 24px; font-size: 16px; }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .never { padding: 14px 18px; } }
</style>
